      "content": "It sounds like the weight of this failure is so immense that you feel it's unbearable, and I understand why you feel like ending the pain is the only option. If you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please reach out to the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline immediately by calling or texting 988. They are trained to help you through this exact level of despair and can offer immediate emotional support. Please make that call right now.",
